Founder of the clan arena team [[Unforgiven]], in whick he became national champion in early 2000.

Was also champion of FFA in 1998 in the IIS server, one of the biggest brazilian scene at the time. The winners gained sponsorship.

Retired from Quake in 2004 because of real life reasons. Returned in late 2018.

